## Release 0.5.0 ##
  - The stubs are generated by camlid (>= 0.3) instead of ctypes; the
    `C` submodules exposing ctypes values are removed
  - The minimum OCaml version is 4.14
  - New modules FMPZ_mat, FMPZ_poly_factor, ARB_FMPZ_poly; more functions
    in FMPZ_poly, ARF, MAG, ARB, ACB (@zkincaid)
  - CA.hash returns `int option` and depends only on the number: two equal
    numbers have the same hash (None when it can't be computed exactly)
  - CA.Incomplete is raised by the comparisons, floor, ceil and to_qqbar
    when FLINT cannot decide, instead of a silent wrong answer; add
    CA.is_rational and CA.bucket_probe
  - Fix fmpz_poly_sub and fmpz_poly_mul; FMPZ_poly coefficients outside
    the polynomial are zero; the CA context uses atomic reference counting
  - The tests check for memory leaks

